    "updated_at": "2015-12-15T22:34:04Z",
    "body": "OK, I guess ES is using Realm to mean Realm Record, per https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/issues/252. I have capitalized it for the one place it is used in that sense here. The other places are in \"realm execution context\" where it is an adjective so I left it lowercase.\n",
