    "created_at": "2016-01-07T06:47:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-07T06:47:39Z",
    "body": "Oh, and importantly are there ever JavaScript execution contexts that do not have a script or a module associated with them?  If not, why not?  What is the ScriptOrModule when the callback function is called in the case above?\n",
